##  Fig 1  coverage by text length, method and language      (main text)
##  Fig 2  set size and single-author rate                    (main text)
##  Fig 3  accuracy inflation vs coverage inflation           (main text)
##  Fig 4  between-novel heterogeneity vs author coverage     (main text)
##  Fig A1 open-set behaviour                                 (supplementary material, Fig. S1)
